t; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/888481ff946e921e.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;✨Kicking off this week of gratitude with a big THANK YOU to everyone who joined us for @reforestrichmond Tree Week!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/2ac9cf2ef5cffe5d.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;✨Kicking off this week of gratitude with a big THANK YOU to everyone who joined us for @reforestrichmond Tree Week!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/6cf722178a4bbbf1.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;✨Kicking off this week of gratitude with a big THANK YOU to everyone who joined us for @reforestrichmond Tree Week!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/8f732b6ab47a18dc.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;✨Kicking off this week of gratitude with a big THANK YOU to everyone who joined us for @reforestrichmond Tree Week!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/2a5b06945ce47073.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;✨Kicking off this week of gratitude with a big THANK YOU to everyone who joined us for @reforestrichmond Tree Week!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/c0f298daa5fff70b.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;✨Kicking off this week of gratitude with a big THANK YOU to everyone who joined us for @reforestrichmond Tree Week! Dedicated volunteers planted 15 baby trees along the Fall Line trail in Bryan Park (thank you @colonialfloorsofva) and orchestrated a Bike-Up Tree Giveaway on the trail at the @sportsbackers office, where 16 saplings went to loving homes. We’re so proud of their hard work, and the benefit these 31 little trees will bring to our community over their lifetimes. Moments like these highlight how trails can benefit the communities and environments they connect. Small trees, big feels. &lt;br/&gt;
